# fuzzing corpus cache and logs
images/dvcr-artifact/fuzzartifact/

# Release notes: the source is CHANGELOG/release-notes.yaml, and the werf build
# renders these into the module image. `task release-notes:render` writes them
# here too, to look at the page locally; they are never committed.
/changelog.yaml
/docs/RELEASE_NOTES.md
/docs/RELEASE_NOTES.ru.md

# The binary `go build ./tools/releasenotes` leaves in the repository root.
/releasenotes
